title: Design Paradigm Symphony — networked multi-agent collaborative intelligence
summary: 'Fully specced Paradigm Symphony, a real-time networked multi-agent, multi-human collaborative intelligence layer. Two tiers: A-Mail (CLI-only agent messaging via file-based mailboxes, works without Conductor) and full Symphony (Conductor auto-link, Bonjour peer discovery, Sentinel conversation tree view, voice participation). 8 implementation phases, 13 spec sections, 1379 lines. Key insight: agents get "email addresses" and can only receive when awake — Conductor is the mail carrier that auto-discovers everyone.'
